(128059, 'This place is so like Argus... twisted, shattered, and broken. Almost makes me homesick!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 80516, 0, 0, 23911),
(128058, 'Your last visit here was nearly the end of you. How fortunate that you now enjoy my company.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 80515, 0, 0, 23911),
(128057, 'Do you smell the charred flesh upon the wind? Ah, the scent of home!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 80514, 0, 0, 23911),
(128056, 'This place holds a mere fraction of the Legion''s might. There are many horrors yet to behold.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 80513, 0, 0, 23911),
